    "Laura is a scientist with a family member affected by EDMD. She participates in cureEDMD researcher meetings, bringing both her scientific background and her family perspective to the conversation.": "Laura es una científica y tiene un familiar afectado por EDMD. Participa en reuniones de investigadores de cureEDMD, aportando a la conversación tanto su formación científica como su perspectiva familiar.",
