    "Ray Mills is the founder and president of cureEDMD and the parent of a son with EDMD. He earned a Ph.D. from Stanford University, a master’s degree from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, and a bachelor’s degree from Virginia Tech. Ray serves on the advisory board of the Fralin Biomedical Research Institute at Virginia Tech Carillion.": "Ray Mills é o fundador e presidente da cureEDMD e pai de um filho com EDMD. Ele obteve um Ph.D. da Universidade de Stanford, mestrado pelo Massachusetts Institute of Technology e bacharelado pela Virginia Tech. Ray atua no conselho consultivo do Fralin Biomedical Research Institute da Virginia Tech Carillion.",
