    "$1.2 million raised for EDMD research: Lammerding Lab at Cornell University; Worman Lab at Columbia University; Valdez Lab at Brown University; Fralin Biomedical Institute at Virginia Tech.": "1,2 Millionen US-Dollar für EDMD-Forschung gesammelt: Lammerding Lab an der Cornell University; Worman Lab an der Columbia University; Valdez Lab an der Brown University; Fralin Biomedical Institute an der Virginia Tech.",
