    "Ray Mills is the founder and president of cureEDMD and the parent of a son with EDMD. He earned a Ph.D. from Stanford University, a master’s degree from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, and a bachelor’s degree from Virginia Tech. Ray serves on the advisory board of the Fralin Biomedical Research Institute at Virginia Tech Carillion.": "Ray Mills è il fondatore e presidente di cureEDMD e genitore di un figlio affetto da EDMD. Ha conseguito un dottorato di ricerca. presso la Stanford University, un master presso il Massachusetts Institute of Technology e una laurea presso la Virginia Tech. Ray fa parte del comitato consultivo del Fralin Biomedical Research Institute presso Virginia Tech Carillion.",
