    "A patient registry is a safe and secure place where people with EDMD and their families can share information about their diagnosis, symptoms, treatments, and everyday experiences. Every person's story is important. When many people join together, researchers can learn more about Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy (EDMD) and work toward better care and new treatments.": "患者登记处是一个安全可靠的地方，EDMD 患者及其家人可以在这里分享有关他们的诊断、症状、治疗和日常经历的信息。每个人的故事都很重要。当许多人联合起来时，研究人员可以更多地了解埃默里-德莱福斯肌营养不良症 (EDMD)，并致力于更好的护理和新的治疗方法。",
