    "EDMD Conference": "EDMD会议",
    "EDMD Conference Planned for Chicago on April 2-4, 2027": "EDMD 会议计划于 2027 年 4 月 2-4 日在芝加哥举行",
    "EDMD Conference planned for April 2-4, 2027 at Hyatt Centric Chicago; room-block interest is open now": "EDMD 会议计划于 2027 年 4 月 2 日至 4 日在芝加哥 Hyatt Centric 举行；房间街区兴趣现已开放",
    "EDMD Group": "EDMD集团",
    "EDMD affects everyone differently. People of all ages, backgrounds, and genetic types are important. Every person who joins helps create a more complete picture of EDMD.": "EDMD 对每个人的影响都不同。所有年龄、背景和基因类型的人都很重要。每个加入的人都有助于更全面地了解 EDMD。",
    "EDMD can affect the heart, including the heart's rhythm and ability to pump normally.": "EDMD 会影响心脏，包括心律和正常泵血的能力。",
    "EDMD can be inherited in three different ways: autosomal dominant, autosomal recessive, or X-linked.": "EDMD 可以通过三种不同的方式遗传：常染色体显性遗传、常染色体隐性遗传或 X 连锁遗传。",
    "EDMD can look very different from one person to another. The age when symptoms begin, how severe they are, and how quickly they progress can vary, even among people in the same family. The symptoms can also vary depending on the gene involved.": "EDMD 因人而异。即使在同一家庭中，症状出现的年龄、严重程度以及进展速度也可能有所不同。症状也可能因所涉及的基因而异。",
    "EDMD conference planned at the Hyatt Centric in downtown Chicago": "EDMD 会议计划在芝加哥市中心凯悦中心酒店举行",
    "EDMD conference planned for April 2–4, 2027 in Chicago. Find conference, hotel, agenda, and registration updates.": "EDMD 会议计划于 2027 年 4 月 2 日至 4 日在芝加哥举行。查找会议、酒店、议程和注册更新。",
    "EDMD genetics, laminopathies, disease models, and therapeutic development": "EDMD 遗传学、核纤层蛋白病、疾病模型和治疗方法开发",
    "EDMD genetics, muscle pathology, and nuclear-envelope disease": "EDMD 遗传学、肌肉病理学和核包膜疾病",
    "EDMD has three main features that help distinguish it from other muscular dystrophies.": "EDMD 具有三个主要特征，有助于将其与其他肌营养不良症区分开来。",
    "EMD": "EMD",
    "EMD + LMNA": "EMD + LMNA",
    "Each variant keeps the same content, navigation, and interactions. The Ember core style stays in place, while each option shifts saturation balance, contrast, and surface tone so you can choose the best campaign direction.": "每个变体都保留相同的内容、导航和交互。 Ember 核心风格保持不变，而每个选项都会改变饱和度平衡、对比度和表面色调，以便您可以选择最佳的营销方向。",
    "Elizabeth M. McNally, MD, PhD": "伊丽莎白·M·麦克纳利，医学博士、哲学博士",
    "Elizabeth McNally is a leading physician-scientist at the intersection of muscular dystrophy and inherited heart disease. Her laboratory uses patient genomics, engineered cells, and animal models to study genes including LMNA, SYNE1, and SYNE2 and to understand why people with related variants develop different degrees of muscle weakness, arrhythmia, and heart failure. Recent work from her group supports a multiple-hit model in which combinations of genetic variants can influence cardiomyopathy penetrance and severity. This broader modifier-gene perspective is especially relevant to the substantial clinical variability seen among people carrying the same EDMD-associated variant.": "伊丽莎白·麦克纳利 (Elizabeth McNally) 是肌营养不良症和遗传性心脏病交叉领域的一位顶尖医学科学家。她的实验室利用患者基因组学、工程细胞和动物模型来研究 LMNA、SYNE1 和 SYNE2 等基因，并了解为什么携带相关变异的人会出现不同程度的肌肉无力、心律失常和心力衰竭。她的团队最近的工作支持多重打击模型，其中遗传变异的组合可以影响心肌病的外显率和严重程度。这种更广泛的修饰基因视角与携带相同 EDMD 相关变异的人群中观察到的显着临床变异尤其相关。",
    "Elizabeth McNally, Northwestern University": "伊丽莎白·麦克纳利，西北大学",
    "Email": "电子邮件",
    "Email Our Team": "给我们的团队发电子邮件",
    "Email Us": "给我们发电子邮件",
    "Ember Signal I": "余烬信号 I",
    "Ember Signal II": "余烬信号II",
