    "Emerin": "艾梅林",
    "Emerin, LEM-domain proteins, BAF, chromatin, and mechanotransduction": "Emerin、LEM 结构域蛋白、BAF、染色质和机械转导",
    "Emerin, laminopathies, muscle-cell mechanics, fibrosis, and gene correction": "艾默林、核纤层蛋白病、肌细胞力学、纤维化和基因校正",
    "Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy (EDMD) is a rare genetic condition that affects the muscles, joints, and heart. It is a type of muscular dystrophy, which means it causes muscles to become weaker over time. EDMD was first described by doctors Alan Emery and Fritz Dreifuss in the 1960s and is named after them. Several different gene changes can cause EDMD. The most common involve the EMD and LMNA genes, but changes in other genes can also lead to the condition.": "埃默里-德赖弗斯肌营养不良症 (EDMD) 是一种罕见的遗传性疾病，会影响肌肉、关节和心脏。它是一种肌肉营养不良症，这意味着它会导致肌肉随着时间的推移而变得虚弱。 EDMD 最初由医生 Alan Emery 和 Fritz Dreifuss 在 20 世纪 60 年代首次描述，并以他们的名字命名。几种不同的基因变化可能导致 EDMD。最常见的是 EMD 和 LMNA 基因，但其他基因的变化也可能导致这种情况。",
    "Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy (EDMD) is a rare genetic neuromuscular condition that affects the joints, muscles, and heart. The mission of cureEDMD is to foster collaboration between patients, families, researchers, and drug developers to enable effective treatments that improve the lifespan and quality of life for those affected by EDMD.": "埃默里-德赖福斯肌营养不良症 (EDMD) 是一种罕见的遗传性神经肌肉疾病，会影响关节、肌肉和心脏。 cureEDMD 的使命是促进患者、家庭、研究人员和药物开发商之间的合作，以实现有效的治疗，提高 EDMD 患者的寿命和生活质量。",
    "Eric C. Schirmer, PhD": "埃里克·席尔默博士",
    "Eric Schirmer studies how nuclear-envelope proteins organize the genome and regulate tissue-specific gene expression. In a 2022-2023 study of cells from patients carrying variants in seven different EDMD-spectrum genes, his group identified recurring abnormalities in fibrosis, metabolism, muscle signaling, RNA splicing, and mitochondrial function. The study was important because it searched for shared disease pathways across genetically different forms of EDMD rather than assuming that every subtype has an entirely separate mechanism. These shared signatures could inform future biomarker panels and treatments that apply across multiple genotypes.": "Eric Sc​​hirmer 研究核膜蛋白如何组织基因组并调节组织特异性基因表达。在一项 2022-2023 年对携带七种不同 EDMD 谱基因变异的患者细胞进行的研究中，他的团队发现了纤维化、代谢、肌肉信号、RNA 剪接和线粒体功能方面反复出现的异常。这项研究很重要，因为它寻找了不同遗传形式 EDMD 的共同疾病途径，而不是假设每种亚型都有完全独立的机制。这些共享的特征可以为未来适用于多种基因型的生物标志物组合和治疗提供信息。",
    "Essential EDMD and laminopathy resources: support, registries, care, trials, and practical next steps.": "基本的 EDMD 和椎板病资源：支持、登记、护理、试验和实际的后续步骤。",
