    "Laura is a scientist with a family member affected by EDMD. She participates in cureEDMD researcher meetings, bringing both her scientific background and her family perspective to the conversation.": "Laura 是一位科学家，她的一位家庭成员患有 EDMD。她参加治愈EDMD研究人员会议，将她的科学背景和家庭观点带入对话中。",
