    "Ray Mills is the founder and president of cureEDMD and the parent of a son with EDMD. He earned a Ph.D. from Stanford University, a master’s degree from the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, and a bachelor’s degree from Virginia Tech. Ray serves on the advisory board of the Fralin Biomedical Research Institute at Virginia Tech Carillion.": "Ray Mills 是 cureEDMD 的创始人兼总裁，也是一名患有 EDMD 的儿子的家长。他获得了博士学位。斯坦福大学学士学位、麻省理工学院硕士学位和弗吉尼亚理工大学学士学位。 Ray 是弗吉尼亚理工大学 Carillion 弗拉林生物医学研究所的顾问委员会成员。",
