    "A healthcare professional meeting with a child who uses a wheelchair and her family": "車椅子を使用する子供とその家族と面談する医療専門家",
    "A minimal overview of what cureEDMD is and why it exists.": "cureEDMD とは何か、およびその存在理由についての最小限の概要。",
    "A patient registry is a safe and secure place where people with EDMD and their families can share information about their diagnosis, symptoms, treatments, and everyday experiences. Every person's story is important. When many people join together, researchers can learn more about Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy (EDMD) and work toward better care and new treatments.": "A patient registry is a safe and secure place where people with EDMD and their families can share information about their diagnosis, symptoms, treatments, and everyday experiences.一人一人の物語が重要です。 When many people join together, researchers can learn more about Emery-Dreifuss muscular dystrophy (EDMD) and work toward better care and new treatments.",
